ly obsessed with money, gambling and retirement. Such people have refinement of perception somewhat less than a cow, and used to give me the &amp;quot;Deer in the Headlights&amp;quot; look if I ever mentioned such things as where all this was leading, or an oath of office as an Officer in the US Army or CT Army Guard. They seemed to be waiting for some type of leader to tell them what to think and do, and generally had no individual rational mentation to speak of.. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/168909411194202988/comments/default/5335655738758543119'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/168909411194202988/comments/default/5335655738758543119'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/open-letter-to-legislative-tyrants-of.html?showComment=1393560619201#c5335655738758543119' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/open-letter-to-legislative-tyrants-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-168909411194202988' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/168909411194202988' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-975710346"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2014 at 10:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-7154586091392285684</id><published>2014-02-27T21:27:25.684-06:00</published><updated>2014-02-27T21:27:25.684-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Yeah, they will reap the whirlwind, and it&amp;#39;s g...</title><content type='html'>Yeah, they will reap the whirlwind, a