 “un-American” for inquiring about the constitutionality of the gun confiscation law.&lt;br /&gt;In Lt. Vance’s own words, “…I am the master….”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Contact info is on the YouTube video page.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://iowntheworld.com/blog/?p=226930</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/168909411194202988/comments/default/6834618915775108515'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/168909411194202988/comments/default/6834618915775108515'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/open-letter-to-legislative-tyrants-of.html?showComment=1393556182139#c6834618915775108515' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/open-letter-to-legislative-tyrants-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-168909411194202988' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/168909411194202988' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-392065140"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2014 at 8:56 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1074517877502424508</id><published>2014-02-27T20:25:44.641-06:00</published><updated>2014-02-27T20:25:44.641-06:00</updated><title type='text'>RE anon February 27, 2014 at 4:07 PM&#xa;&#xa;http://www.a...</title><content type='html'>RE anon February 27, 2014 at 4:07 PM&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.amazon.com/Klean-Strip-VM-P-Naphtha-Quart/dp/B001G9TGQI&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.amazon.com/Cubic-Styrene-Refill-Pellets-Adult/dp/B008SD97AK&lt;br /&gt;&