ut I live in the South so..*shrug*&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;At any rate those officers of the state police if they are sent out on door to door confiscation raids[and I believe they are going to be] are about to violate part of their oaths.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/168909411194202988/comments/default/8931435220746829680'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/168909411194202988/comments/default/8931435220746829680'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/open-letter-to-legislative-tyrants-of.html?showComment=1393550322634#c8931435220746829680' title=''/><author><name>Da Curly Wolf</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07631427436506831892</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='18' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-6bjRH7uaqc0/TpAAaMYGA3I/AAAAAAAAAB4/hIVKxYe4NVA/s220/317880_220206594707208_100001536079705_656573_1286759357_n.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/open-letter-to-legislative-tyrants-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-168909411194202988' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/168909411194202988' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-561745031"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2014 at 7:18 PM"/></entry></feed>